WEBVTT

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.500
"SECOND HOSPITAL"

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.950
Performing a vitals check.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.580
There's a problem in the NICU. Call the doctor!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.540
Yes!

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.160
"NAME: REIKA SATO"

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.120
To be blunt, your child may not survive.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.620
That's where we stand now.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:48.370
That can't be right! Can't you do anything?

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.700
Ma'am, your body is quite weak.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.370
For both mother and child
to survive would be a miracle.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.830
The scent of the flowers...

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.330
the murmur of wind through the trees...

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.830
the twittering of birds...

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.160
I suppose we live life
so that we learn about them.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.790
I don't care what happens to me.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.330
So please...

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.580
...please save her, if nothing else.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:25.120
I don't care if nothing good
happens to me ever again.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.870
I won't wish for anything.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:35.040
We'll raise her to be
a noble, just, and honest person.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.750
So, God, please...

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.000
Please save Reika!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.200
"Between the Even and Odd Numbers"

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.700
"Between the Even and Odd Numbers"

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.700
What are all of these?

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.580
Did all of these come out last night?

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.290
As far as we can tell,
all twenty Orders were issued last night.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.580
Twenty?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:31.200
It's downright spawnin' like a clownfish!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.500
You know a lot about those?

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.290
I saw it in a movie.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:39.870
Let's see...
Nicole, you get to do a modeling job.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.120
And, Miyako, you get to be a radio personality!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.660
On the radio? Really?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.660
Everyone has jobs!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.910
--Seems like we have some jobs debuting on TV
and attending events as a group as well.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.500
--Where?
--Seems like we have some jobs debuting on TV
and attending events as a group as well.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.950
There's precise instructions
for carrying out each task!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:57.000
That's not so bad is it?
Plus I love cream puffs!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.370
But still...

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:02.750
Realistically, there's no way
we can get all of this work done.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:07.120
It's easier said than done.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.160
His face is so cute,
but Mr. Wall really asks too much of us.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.200
You can do it.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.910
All of the work written on those plates

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:21.660
are previous offers
we already had from various enterprises.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.410
It might be more correct
to say that this is the Wall

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.870
giving its de facto approval
to take those jobs.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.330
What?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.950
Which means the Wall
knew about all of these jobs before?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.160
As far as we know.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.700
That's so amazing!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.540
Mr. Wall really is amazing!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.910
It's like they're a magician!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:42.370
Your simpleminded celebrating is amazing!

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:48.120
There is one completely different job
mixed with the rest.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.040
What?

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.000
"THE LEADER SHALL BE REIKA SATO"

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.750
The leader?

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.160
W-Wait just a second!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.910
This is all so sudden!

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:01.370
But it's one of the Wall's Orders,
and you can't refuse one of those,

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.000
so it's basically decided.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.120
--But--
--I agree.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:11.580
Sato is serious and sincere,
and she takes responsibility for things.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.830
By her nature, she's very leaderlike.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.290
Yep, yep.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.620
W-Wouldn't Nicole be a better choice as leader?

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.290
I'll pass.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.450
Sheesh, why do you think
this is someone else's problem?

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.120
Just look at that face. So smug.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.580
Comforted in the knowledge
they've done a good job.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.450
It's just a stuffed animal!

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:30.700
--Yes... Yes...

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.500
--It's no laughing matter, though.
--Yes... Yes...

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.500
She's right!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.040
Stop talking like that!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:39.120
On that note,
we'll be heading to Okinawa next.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.080
What?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.620
"HAVE A PHOTO SHOOT FOR A BOOK
AT A BEACH IN OKINAWA"

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.870
Yay! We're at the beach!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:05.580
The waves are so beautiful.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.870
--I'll go first!
--I'm first!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.120
It's so cold!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.950
Miu, you're so adorable!

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.660
Your skin really is pale!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.700
I-Is it?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:26.450
Why in the world
did you bring that toy with you?

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.750
It's thanks to Mr. Wall that we got
a trip to Okinawa in the first place!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.040
I'd feel bad if I left him back in Tokyo!

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.000
She really called it a trip.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.160
It's meaningless to ask
that kind of professionalism of Toda.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.540
--Lookin' good, Nicole!
--Like this?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.290
--Okay, gonna take it!
--Okay, okay! Okay, cheese!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.700
--An Okinawan photobook shoot, though.
--Okay, gonna take it!
--Okay, okay! Okay, cheese!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.700
--An Okinawan photobook shoot, though.
--So what's on the
schedule for today?

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.950
--I'm looking forward to it.
--Those sata andagi
look pretty delicious.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.200
--Hmm? Oh, yeah!
--Those sata andagi
look pretty delicious.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.830
--Where's Reika?
--Welcome back!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.080
What is this?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.370
What is this? What is this?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.500
What is this?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:03.290
There's no way I can wear a swimsuit,
not one like th-this.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.500
Sato, everyone is waiting on you.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.790
Gouda, what in the world is going on?

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.160
I'm not sure what you mean.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.750
You didn't mention a swimsuit photo shoot!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.160
Moreover, this...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:19.450
...isn't this design a little too much?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:23.160
To idols, your style is a weapon.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.910
The costume department
considered that for this shoot.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.950
W-Weapon?

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:35.750
I'm saying that brainwashing fans
with such seductive clothing is cruel!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.830
Are you unable to go through with this?

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.370
I-Isn't that obvious by now?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.450
The Wall's Orders are absolute.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:48.290
For now, I'm going to go ahead
and get the rest of the shoot lined up.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.950
Be sure to eat your breakfast
before it gets cold.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.000
Dad!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.580
You need to get up and get ready!

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:14.790
Didn't the head of your office say
you need to get there 15 minutes earlier?

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.790
Strict as usual, aren't you, Reika?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.290
You don't need to be that stubborn, do you?

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.160
What are you saying?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.080
You're to live nobly and justly.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:24.950
Isn't that what you promised Mom?

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.370
"THANKS, DAD"

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.370
Isn't that what you promised Mom?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.750
If I let you break that promise
as your daughter, what would happen?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.750
Are you even listening?

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:38.870
You're so undisciplined, I swear.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.580
Sheesh.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:02.200
Oh, no, I couldn't possibly wear this.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.040
Boing!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.790
Slash!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.330
I-If you're going to tease me,
then you can get out!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.160
We're not actually trying to be mean.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.290
We're trying to cheer you up.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:19.370
That's right! Besides, seeing ourselves naked
isn't a whole lot of fun.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.830
There's no harm in a little peek.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.330
Y-You're being too extreme!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:28.370
Though we have no idea how highly
a princess like you evaluates yourself.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:31.080
I-It's not about that!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.450
Anyway, it's about your frame of mind.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.410
Yep! Since we're so far south,
it wouldn't hurt to loosen up.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.830
Seeing you right now...

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:47.000
...it's like that student that knows the answer,
but can't raise their hand.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.410
And I can't help but think how lonely you look.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:15.330
Reika didn't show up.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:18.200
When is she coming?
When?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.500
I really wanna take
some pictures with Reika soon!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.200
After we take a break,
we'll be doing the one-on-one shoots.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.450
That's what they have planned.
You'll have a chance to take some with her.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.040
But she's still all... you know.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:34.290
Seriously, why is she being so stubborn?

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.700
Um, where are you...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:42.790
For a walk.

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.540
Nicole.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:56.620
Even if it's pinup shoots,
that's completely honorable work for an idol.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.200
At least, that's how I'm looking at it.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:03.120
As a pro, you're supposed to carry out
the obligations you've been given.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.450
Are you seriously our leader?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.580
Pro. Leader.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:19.910
I don't even know what I should do.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.080
What?! You dumped Kamiyama?

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.790
You mean the esteemed gentleman
of our high school? What a waste!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.580
But if I dated him,
when would I have time to study?

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.200
Reika, you're so serious.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.080
Wh-When you put it that way...

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.700
You're always the one our teachers trust.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.540
You're recommended for a position
when we have student elections.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.700
If we had a beauty pageant,
you'd win first place,

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.330
but the fact you have no boyfriend is tragic!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.290
Isn't a student's duty to study?

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:54.370
I want to find a job
that will enable me to contribute to society

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.950
so I can ease some of the burden
off Dad a little faster. That's my main goal.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.000
There it is, Reika's father complex.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.830
I-It's not a father complex!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.830
Isn't it normal to treat
any of your family as precious?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:10.620
That reminds me, Reika's Dad came over
recently to fix one of our pipes.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.500
He got really mad at his assistant.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:18.120
It was like he was so disappointed in him.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:22.580
--But he still has his good points.
--That's, like, so undistinguished of him!
--You can say that again!

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.910
"ENTRANCE CEREMONY"

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.370
Dad.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.700
Is he against you doing this, perhaps?

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:33.580
Your Dad, I mean.
Against you doing work in a swimsuit?

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.910
He doesn't really seem against it.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.450
Aren't you two?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.700
I mean, it is a little bit embarrassing.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.250
R-Right?

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.450
Even though we're idols,
this seems a bit immoral.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:56.950
If we try to win over fans with swimsuits,
can they really call themselves our fans?

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.450
Shouldn't they look
at what's on the inside, too?

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:04.160
There's something wrong with us not resisting
and embracing this sort of work.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:13.950
I don't think any of us
aren't putting up a resistance.

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.910
All of us are girls, after all.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.370
Okay, stop. For the next shot,
let's try to make it sexy, yeah?

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:20.410
Like this?

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.830
L-Leave it to us!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.000
You guys were great!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:24.790
--Well, we're in charge
of bringing the sexy, right?

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:29.160
--We're all a little embarrassed
and feel awkward.
--Well, we're in charge
of bringing the sexy, right?

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:36.790
But if we can use the same energy we use
to sing and dance to meet those expectations,

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:40.250
I think that's what we all want to do.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:48.000
And I think it's a good thing
to want to meet those expectations.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.120
Sakura.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:57.620
Miu... Did you mind?

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:02.750
Did you think about it
when the Wall made you center?

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.250
--Yeah.
--Thought so.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:09.000
But I thought I'd try it...

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:12.080
...because I thought
that it was something I could do.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:21.580
But I also think
you're the only leader here, Reika.

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.080
Miu.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:35.910
Even though I'm the leader,
what the hell am I doing right now?

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.500
"MISS REIKA SATO"

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.250
What's this?

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.660
GIP?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.370
What? A pay cut?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:53.120
Yeah, probably because of the recession.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.200
So what are we going to do?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.450
Our living expenses are already stretched.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.910
Our landlord is already waiting
on a month's worth of rent as it is.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.450
Well, we'll figure out something.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.080
Reika, what's that?

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.660
It's a letter from a talent agency?

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:13.790
Something about being chosen as an idol,
or something suspicious like that.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:16.910
An idol?
Does that mean you've been scouted?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.830
I'd love to see you as an idol!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.750
--What?
--Yeah, yeah!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.540
There aren't many cute girls like you!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.370
You really are your mother's daughter!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.410
What?

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:31.120
And if it's an agency, you'll get a paycheck.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.870
What a lifesaver!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.450
St-Stop that!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.000
I'm not even thinking of becoming an idol.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.870
I'd have to be alone in Tokyo.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.790
On top of that...

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:46.750
If I leave, will you be okay, Dad?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:56.950
As long as you're alive, Reika,
that's enough for me.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:58.580
What?

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.910
I've been thinking since you were born...

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.830
"HAPPY BIRTHDAY!"

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.330
You're here in this world.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:09.830
And just that fact alone
has made me happier than anyone else.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:12.250
Dad...

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.040
D-Dummy!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.080
Don't say such embarrassing stuff!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.290
And I'll get to see you in cute clothes!

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.250
That's all you care about, huh?

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:39.790
Reika...

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.370
Just what the heck am I doing?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.000
Is it okay if I sit next to you?

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.410
Akane.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.290
I've just come to deliver some news.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.080
In the event you don't put that swimsuit on,

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.410
the rest of the shoot will likely be canceled.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:14.950
Meaning they'll cancel
the rest of what we're doing today.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:19.790
All the expenses outlaid for today
will have been wasted.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.040
The photobook won't sell,

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:26.750
so all of the collateral
tied to its promotion will be scrapped.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:31.620
If we don't fulfill the Wall's Orders,
our future is uncertain.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:37.450
On the other hand, if you wear that swimsuit,
everything will be normal.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.700
Normal.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:42.830
The shoot will proceed,
and the photobook will release without issue.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:46.040
I understand the agency's intent
when it comes to the effect of publicity

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.250
and how that relates to making new fans.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:54.700
But in return, your pride will be hurt, Sato.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:18:01.000
Objectively, I do think the latter
is a more rational approach.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:03.790
That's true.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:06.080
I've been a fool.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:09.080
I'm always the one to lecture others...

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:13.700
...and yet I'm the one
with the least resolve to be an idol.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:18.000
There's no way I'm fit to be leader.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.700
I have one more bit of news for you.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:27.290
I don't really like your sad face, Sato.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.950
Akane.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.870
That was my sentimental argument.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:36.290
You don't have to refer to it
when making a decision.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.790
There's something
I carry with me wherever I go.

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.830
What? I-In there?

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.790
It's only a part of my body,

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.700
the same as holding it under my arm.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.250
I don't really carry things under my arm.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.910
The truth is that people have feelings,

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:58.750
and it's not always possible to be logical
when making decisions.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.500
Odd, wear the swimsuit.
Even, you won't.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.830
It's just a charm,
but it might be the motivation you need.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.370
Was this is too much for Reika after all?

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:34.290
The Wall is an absolute source for 22/7.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:38.620
If we can't fulfill its directives,
then that means one thing.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.580
Miss Sato?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.910
Reika.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.500
Reika!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:02.750
Miss Sato, are you okay?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.950
You a geezer?

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:20.950
Please excuse me for causing such a fuss.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.410
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.620
I look forward
to working with you all on this shoot.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.620
We were waiting for you!

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:38.870
Sorry!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:40.160
Ow.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.000
Are you okay?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.870
Thank you for this blessing!

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.790
A-Are you both stupid?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:50.080
Don't get me wrong.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:51.500
Regardless of the form,

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:55.660
I don't think it's odd to try
to exceed people's expectations, is all.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.410
Reika.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:58.950
I'm so glad.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.000
So you rolled odd, huh?

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.660
Yeah. Thank you, Akane.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.040
As leader.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.160
Right?

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.200
"1. DON'T BE UNTIDY
2. NO LAZING ABOUT
3. BE ON TIME"

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:15.580
Don't be untidy, no lazing about,
and be on time!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.410
Okay, one more time.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:21.620
Don't be untidy, no lazing about,
and be on time!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.500
Now that I'm leader,
I'll make sure you abide by those rules!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:27.830
These will now be the three principles of 22/7,

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:31.200
and those that can't follow
these rules will get spanked.

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.120
You're gonna spank us? That's hilarious!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.500
She's more determined.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.000
"22/7 1ST PHOTOBOOK"

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.080
"22/7 1ST PHOTOBOOK"

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.080
Did you hear?

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:11.540
The first edition sold over 10,000 units!

00:23:11.540 --> 00:23:13.870
Apparently it's pretty popular, too!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:17.660
Seems like us being requested for events
and personal jobs has increased.

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:21.330
Apparently some industry insiders
are saying the tide has turned for us, too.

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:24.910
We've only been a group for six months,
but things seem to be going well.

00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:26.750
The Wall issued Orders about participation,

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:29.290
so it seems like we're
going to get even busier.

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:32.040
Is this all thanks to Mr. Wall, I wonder?

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.540
Things are going swimmingly for 22/7!

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:37.120
Y-Yeah!

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:41.580
All right, let's continue 22/7's domination!

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:43.910
Yeah!

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:46.500
You think we're getting a new song soon?

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:50.370
I wonder what kind of song
we're getting next?

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:54.620
--Huh? Hold on, Miu!
--Miu!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.700
--Miu?
--What happened?

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:09.750
"Episode 7: Happy☆Jet☆Coaster!"

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:11.830
"Episode 7: Happy☆Jet☆Coaster!"

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:11.830
"Happy Jet Coaster!"
